section.para:
Resolution results which contain a non-root bean marked with
    @SingleComponent or @FactoryComponent result in
    a definition error.

However, the name may be specified by adding
      @javax.inject.Named directly to the bean and specifying a
      value whose syntax follows cname defined by the .

