section.para:
The terminal bind() method must be called to inform CCR
    that the bind process is complete. Binding a subset of methods is allowed.
    Only the last bind method specified for any given service event will be
    used. For example, given the following invocation: @Inject
void bindDogs(BindService<Dog> binder) {
	binder.
		adding(this::addingA).
		adding(this::addingB).
		bind();
} only the method addingB will be used.

